cmu-wendigo-lab-first-meal = The meat tastes... right. Your stomach aches for more.
cmu-wendigo-lab-fed-again = The gnawing in your gut grows sharper.
cmu-wendigo-lab-mutagen = A cold, crawling heat spreads through your veins.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-start = Something inside you wakes up. It is hungry.
cmu-wendigo-lab-aborted = The gnawing hunger fades.
cmu-wendigo-lab-not-ready = Your body is not ready for that yet.
cmu-wendigo-lab-dose-too-small = Your veins tingle, then settle. It wasn't enough.

cmu-wendigo-lab-seizure = Your muscles lock and your body convulses!
cmu-wendigo-lab-seizure-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} convulses violently!
cmu-wendigo-lab-ready-mutagen = Your veins burn and your stomach growls.
cmu-wendigo-lab-ready-gestation = Something inside you is ready to break loose.
cmu-wendigo-lab-shiver-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} shivers uncontrollably.

cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-1 = You are so hungry. So very hungry.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-2 = Your skin feels stretched too tight across your frame.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-3 = You feel your organs shift and slide inside you.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-4 = Your bones grind and creak as they rearrange themselves.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-5 = Your teeth ache. They feel longer.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-6 = The smell of the people around you makes your mouth water.

cmu-wendigo-lab-mutation-warning-1 = YOUR BODY IS MUTATING!
cmu-wendigo-lab-mutation-warning-2 = YOUR BONES ARE SPLITTING AND REFORMING!
cmu-wendigo-lab-mutation-warning-3 = YOUR SKIN IS TEARING OPEN!
cmu-wendigo-lab-mutation-warning-4 = YOU CAN NO LONGER FEEL WHERE YOU END!
cmu-wendigo-lab-mutation-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} thrashes as their body twists and stretches!

cmu-wendigo-lab-briefing = Your mind blurs and your memories meld together, you have become a Wendigo. A twisted husk of what you once were. A constant hunger gnaws at your insides, feed it.
cmu-wendigo-lab-briefing-tamed = Your mind blurs, your memories meld and twist as your ability to think wanes. You have become a Wendigo. A twisted husk of what you once were. A constant hunger gnaws at your insides, but you feel compelled to listen to {$master}.
cmu-wendigo-lab-transformed-others = {$subject}'s body tears apart into a towering, pale creature!
cmu-wendigo-lab-unknown-master = whoever made you

cmu-wendigo-lab-examine-ready = [color=#b03a2e]They are shaking and pale. Something is changing.[/color]
cmu-wendigo-lab-examine-mutating = [color=#b03a2e][bold]Their body is twisting into something else![/bold][/color]
cmu-wendigo-lab-examine-tamed = It seems compelled to obey {$master}.

cmu-wendigo-lab-round-end-header = [color=#b03a2e]Weyland-Yutani test subjects:[/color]
cmu-wendigo-lab-round-end = {$subject} was turned into a Wendigo.
cmu-wendigo-lab-round-end-tamed = {$subject} was turned into a Wendigo bound to {$master}.
